          "id": "5ee54ffac964abae2053497f7242934dd683dfea",
          "message": "chore: capture RPC calls + correct timings (#14633)\n\nThis PR allows us to run simulation with an instrumented node, that we\ncan hijack to capture timing information on RPC calls. It also addresses\na bug that made us measure witgen time incorrectly (and incidentally\ncaused the unnacounted time to sometimes go negative)\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Nicolás Venturo <nicolas.venturo@gmail.com>",
