          "message": "fix(docs): Add get_version script to the update docs job on release please (#14740)\n\nSince we are no longer displaying the \"Next\" docs that are built from\ndocs/docs, we need to specify a version to build. This PR adds a script\nto specify the latest version available to build, so they do build\nproperly.\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: James Zaki <james.zaki@proton.me>",
